# Auto Calendar Events — MANDATORY

**When ANY call, meeting, or hard deadline is confirmed: AUTOMATICALLY generate an .ics calendar file and open it. No asking. No waiting. Just do it.**

## When to Trigger

Generate a calendar event when:
- A call or meeting is confirmed (date, time, and contact known)
- A bid deadline is identified with a specific date
- A follow-up date is set
- Any time-sensitive action is scheduled

## .ics File Format

Save to: `calendars/[EVENT_NAME].ics`

```
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Dee Davis Inc//NEXUS Bid Tracker//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:NEXUS Bids
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/Detroit

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:[UNIQUE_ID]@deedavis.biz
DTSTAMP:[NOW]
DTSTART:[START_TIME_ET]
DTEND:[END_TIME_ET]
SUMMARY:[EMOJI] [TYPE]: [Description]
DESCRIPTION:[All relevant details — contact info, dial-in, prep checklist, folder location]
LOCATION:[Meeting link or submission method]
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P1D
DESCRIPTION:[Event] tomorrow
ACTION:DISPLAY
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT2H
DESCRIPTION:[Event] in 2 hours
ACTION:DISPLAY
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
DESCRIPTION:[Event] in 30 minutes
ACTION:DISPLAY
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
```

## Emoji Prefixes

- Calls/Meetings: 📞
- Bid Deadlines: 🔥
- Follow-ups: 📧
- Portal/Registration tasks: 📋

## Reminders

- Calls/Meetings: 1 day, 2 hours, 30 minutes before
- Bid Deadlines: 3 days, 1 day, 2 hours before
- Follow-ups: 1 day before

## After Creating

Run `open "calendars/[FILE].ics"` to import into Apple Calendar automatically.

## Time Zone

Dee is in Eastern Time (America/Detroit). All DTSTART/DTEND values must be in ET. If an event is scheduled in another timezone (e.g., CT), convert to ET first.
